<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 34.29 to 5972.73.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.28 to 370.98.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.24.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1530 to 865.</p>
<p>Volume was 383,634,340, compared with 364,980,270 Friday.</p>
<p>	     (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
